        date: 'c. 1500 — the dating of Vísindavefurinn, the University of Iceland’s Web of Science (answer 81960), and of its English version on why.is. A review of Kålund’s edition puts the manuscript in the second half of the fifteenth century, and another account in its last quarter; the Hólmavík museum’s older web page calls it a seventeenth-century manuscript, against every other source.',
